Today is Wednesday.
I am at the office.
I am working at my desk.
Now the time is three o'clock in the afternoon.
There is always a lot of work in the office.
Prakash is working at the next desk.
Then a message comes on my phone.
It is my neighbor Anitha.
Anitha sometimes sends messages in the afternoon.
"Maya, are you free tomorrow?" Anitha asks.
Tomorrow is Thursday.
"Let's go drink coffee in the evening," the message says.
"Can we go at five thirty in the evening?"
I drink coffee every day.
I quickly type a reply.
"Okay, we can meet at five thirty."
I put the phone on the desk.
I start working again.
